# XIAO nRF52840 Sense — boot + live IMU contract (DSL form)
# Run: POST /contracts/parse  (or evcide.dsl.parse_contract)
@id xiao-boot-imu
@target seeed_xiao_nrf52840_sense
@receiver serial
@timeout 12000

contains BOOT_OK within_ms:3000
no_timeout 1500
field accel_x not_frozen
field accel_x range:-20..20
not_contains PANIC
